# #1293 KS-1344 (B 32nd (raised from the KS-1344 golden; the Ornith output differs by a hunk-header suffix and one trailing context line; re-verified by the seat), T2) · #1295 KS-1337 (B 32nd (local-model patch, byte-identical to brief-akto golden; re-verified by the seat), T2)
